{"fixes":[{"id":8,"status":"not-resolved","note":"synthAttempt is appended only at terminal aggregation; verify recursion carries thisAttempt but omits synthAttempt, losing that invocation. Also thisAttempt.costUsd uses turnCost, which already includes synthesis cost, so terminal attempts double-count synthesis cost."},{"id":9,"status":"resolved","note":"Both nudge and verify recursion append this turn's forced_synthesis before tool_nudge or verification_retry, preserving recovery order without duplication."}],"new_P0_P1":[{"severity":"P1","note":"Per-attempt cost accounting double-counts successful synthesis because thisAttempt.costUsd includes the synthesis delta and synthAttempt.costUsd records that delta again."}]}
